[00:11.06]1. How can we endure
[00:14.72]When trials come, as Jesus said?
[00:21.28]Through his pain he saw
[00:24.30]The joy of better things ahead.
[00:29.94]God’s promise, God’s justice,
[00:34.62]Were thoughts on which he fed.
[00:39.98](Chorus)
[00:39.98]We need to have endurance.
[00:45.10]Our faith we must defend.
[00:49.40]His love is our assurance.
[00:54.26]So we will keep enduring to the end.
[01:12.00]2. Though the passing years
[01:14.06]May bring us sorrow, bring us pain;
[01:21.30]There beyond the tears,
[01:23.84]We see the life that we can gain.
[01:28.90]To be there, feel free there,
[01:34.48]Determined we remain.
[01:38.84](Chorus)
[01:38.86]We need to have endurance.
[01:44.50]Our faith we must defend.
[01:49.34]His love is our assurance.
[01:53.74]So we will keep enduring to the end.
[02:20.23]3. We will not give up
[02:23.37]Nor see the need for doubt or fear.
[02:30.45]Faithfully we’ll serve
[02:32.90]Until Jehovah’s day is here.
[02:38.09]Let’s keep on enduring.
[02:43.21]That time is very near.
[02:48.05](Chorus)
[02:48.05]We need to have endurance.
[02:53.73]Our faith we must defend.
[02:58.39]His love is our assurance.
[03:02.89]So we will keep enduring to the end.
